**6. PERFORMANCE, COMPATIBILITY, AND REQUIRED TESTING**

All new mechanics must integrate properly with the existing game.

Pay special attention to compatibility between:
- Boss teleportation and boss procedural animations.
- Boss teleportation and pathfinding.
- Component destruction and existing damage calculations.
- Component damage and enemy AI behavior.
- Shield destruction and squadmate health.
- Camera zoom and battlefield visibility.
- Dynamic music and simultaneous enemy encounters.

Avoid creating unnecessary objects every frame, excessive particle effects, expensive calculations, or duplicate AI controllers.

